Welcome to fielddEDU, the free learning series that helps you master running your business.

Your time is valuable, and so is your schedule. Fieldd’s booking system maximizes customer value and optimizes your team’s efficiency. Every booking is more than just a spot on your calendar—it’s the foundation of a premium customer experience.

In this episode, we’ll cover best practices for booking jobs to ensure accuracy and efficiency. You’ll learn how to add essential details like taxes, discounts, customers, and notes, as well as how to customize each booking to fit your business needs.

Watch now to get started, and keep an eye out for more fielddEDU videos to master running your business.

